<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Workspaces (中文)</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/</link><description>探索激发生产力的工作空间。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:27:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>马克西姆·赫克尔</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/534-maxime-heckel</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://maximeheckel.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Maxime Heckel&lt;/a&gt; 是一位来自法国的软件工程师，现居纽约市。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他目前是 Linear 的产品工程师。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;在业余时间，他热衷于前端开发、WebGL/WebGPU、着色器以及更广泛的图形编程。这个计算机科学领域是知识的无尽源泉，他在过去 5 年中尽可能多地学习。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他正在记录所有这些学习成果，并将其提炼成实验和文章——这些正是他在刚开始时希望拥有的内容，发布在他的博客上，这也是他持续最久的副项目（今年已是第 8 年）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter (X) → &lt;a href="https://x.com/MaximeHeckel?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;x.com/MaximeHeckel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;GitHub → &lt;a href="https://github.com/maximeheckel?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;github.com/maximeheckel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;博客 → &lt;a href="https://blog.maximeheckel.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;blog.maximeheckel.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/51290c69-a48a-4a66-b279-b1841120bb59/Maxime_Heckel_4.jpg?t=1782561893"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b2c38fec-b6e2-4d6e-a891-318c70d1c677/Maxime_Heckel_2.jpg?t=1782561918"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/edfbb91b-5786-4fa8-a22c-482532a45b36/Maxime_Heckel_9.jpg?t=1782561983"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6a93ab2b-14db-45af-b2a7-a0ef439d4b3c/Maxime_Heckel_8.jpg?t=1782562008"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a5a7f174-c050-44d4-9232-38edc0d732b6/Maxime_Heckel_5.jpg?t=1782562033"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/71812809-cdd9-4c83-96f1-82df035cf444/Maxime_Heckel_1.jpg?t=1782562063"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些物品？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;显示器：2022 年的 27 英寸 Apple Studio Display&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MacBook Pro M4 Max，36GB 内存（银色）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;显示器支架臂：&lt;a href="https://store.hermanmiller.com/home-desk-accessories/jarvis-single-monitor-arm/2548325.html?lang=en_US&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Fully 的 Jarvis 单臂显示器支架&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;桌面垫：Grovemade 羊毛毡桌面垫（浅灰色）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;键盘：&lt;a href="https://modedesigns.com/products/sixtyfive?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Mode SixtyFive（2024），铜色点缀&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;鼠标：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4g3W0fD?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MX Master 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;触控板：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4wd84zN?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Apple Magic Trackpad（USB-C）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/airpods-pro/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;AirPods Pro 3&lt;/a&gt; 是我在办公桌前或外出时的日常耳机&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;需要高麦克风质量时使用 Apple 有线耳机 USB-C 版&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;台灯：&lt;a href="https://www.mi.com/global/product/mi-led-desk-lamp-1s/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;小米智能台灯 Pro&lt;/a&gt;（我觉得现在已经买不到了）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;笔袋：&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4beLDSO?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;无印良品聚丙烯笔盒&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;书籍&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://fleuret.org/francois/lbdl.html?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《深度学习小书》&lt;/a&gt; Francois Fleuret 著&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3R1EbDP?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《设计的形态》&lt;/a&gt; Frank Chimero 著&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://buddybindery.com/products/bootstrapping-computing?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《自举计算》&lt;/a&gt; Alexander D. Obenauer 著&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;（虽然我在科技行业工作，但我并不是"技术书籍"的狂热爱好者，不过这三本书我真的很喜欢，而且恰好与我的桌面美学很搭）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你日常经常使用哪些软件？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://arc.net/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Arc 浏览器&lt;/a&gt;（到了这个地步，除非从我冰冷的尸体上跨过去，否则别想让我换掉它）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.raycast.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Raycast&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://mymind.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MyMind&lt;/a&gt; 用来保存灵感&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://cursor.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Cursor&lt;/a&gt; 作为我的主要编辑器（我仍然手动写代码）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://openai.com/codex/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Codex&lt;/a&gt;（当我不想手动写代码时）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://ghostty.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ghostty&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://linear.app/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Linear&lt;/a&gt;（即使在工作之外也使用）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Notes（这是我所有信息的核心来源，我存储和整理即将开展的项目灵感以及博客文章的主题想法）。我喜欢这些内容可以离线使用，并自动在所有设备之间同步，无需额外操心。我信任 Apple 来保管我的笔记，不过我确实设置了一些脚本，每月以 Markdown 格式备份一次，"以防万一"，同时也可以尝试其他笔记应用&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://superwhisper.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Superwhisper&lt;/a&gt;（当我想对电脑说话而不是打字的时候）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你最近添加到工作空间的物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;是我那把 &lt;a href="https://modedesigns.com/products/sixtyfive?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Mode 65 键盘&lt;/a&gt;，是 2024 年入手的。我错过了第一代 Mode 65，当时还挺难过的，所以当第二代发布时，我立刻下手买了。这是我第一把机械键盘。我选择它是因为：&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;紧凑的外形设计&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;材质：全铝制，手感厚重且高档&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;我选择了铜色点缀，为桌面增添一抹低调的色彩&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你希望对自己当前的工作空间做哪一项改变？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我最大的遗憾是选择了 VESA 壁挂版本的 Studio Display，而不是带高度可调支架的那款。我女朋友用的是可调支架款，调节起来比我的显示器支架臂舒服太多了。由于这款显示器现在已经有了第二代，我可能会忍不住升级，终于一偿所愿。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;另一个小细节是关于我的笔记本电脑支架，理想情况下我想把它们藏在显示器后面，让桌面保持整洁，因为我的桌面比较小。我看到有人为 MacBook 3D 打印定制支架，但我还没尝试过。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;请带我们了解一下你的晨间流程——你到办公桌前做的第一件事是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;第一件事是把我的小托盘端过来，上面放着一杯手冲咖啡和一份快速的早餐（我知道在办公桌前吃饭不是好习惯，但我还是这么做）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;在吃喝的同时，我会处理所有工作相关的事务：欧洲同事隔夜提交的 Pull Request 审查、新报告的 issue 等等。我总是很怕这部分，因为一大早就可能被大量信息淹没，所以我搭配咖啡一起进行，让它稍微愉快一些。我尽量尽快把它处理完，这样我就可以迅速安排一天的工作&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;哪一个生产力技巧对你真正有效？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我有很多正在进行的副项目，包括我的博客和着色器相关的工作。这可能会让人感到不堪重负，尤其是在学习一个全新主题的时候。我总是尽量每天花至少 1 小时一点点推进我的任务清单。每日目标总是很容易达成，并不需要花那么多时间。通常，一旦我完成了它，我就会进入心流状态并继续推进项目，往往比预期走得更远。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;另一个技巧是下班后保持桌面整洁干净；我很少让它变得乱七八糟。如果桌面井然有序，我更愿意坐下来投入工作。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你每天使用的最被低估的应用或工具是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;到了现在它已经谈不上被低估了，但 &lt;a href="https://raycast.com?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Raycast&lt;/a&gt; 是我互动最多的应用（当然除了 Linear 以外）。以下是我最喜欢的扩展：&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;窗口管理：我设置了快捷键，可以非常轻松地移动窗口并在不同尺寸之间循环切换，这让我能够保持桌面环境整洁有序&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Reminders（苹果提醒事项）：基本上通过 Raycast 来操控 Apple Reminders 中的所有内容，快速设置提醒，或使用自然语言设置提醒&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Download Video X/Twitter：任何分享出来且我稍后想查阅的工作内容最终都会存入我的个人离线存档（我已经不再相信任何人会永久保留自己的账号了，所以我会存档大量设计、URL，以及在这种情况下还有包含着色器、动画等的视频）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Quick Links（快速链接）：我为每个项目设置了快速链接，一键打开对应的编辑器并访问它们的自定义 URL，全部直接通过 Raycast 完成&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;另外，还要特别提一下 &lt;a href="https://mymind.com?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=maxime-heckel" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;MyMind&lt;/a&gt;，它是我第二常用的应用。这大概是我用过设计最用心的一款应用了&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788659481&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=cd11bcb7-065f-4b3f-be2d-af27de46a7e4&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 27 Jun 2026 13:27:04 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>罗天成</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/533-tiancheng-luo</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Tiancheng Luo (aka bbbigdear) is a product designer and tech and lifestyle creator focused on workspace aesthetics, modern living, and thoughtfully designed technology. Through cinematic storytelling and hands-on product exploration, he shares tools and objects that blend functionality with visual design.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instagram → &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/bbbigdeer/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;instagram.com/bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Threads → &lt;a href="https://www.threads.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;threads.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;TikTok → &lt;a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;tiktok.com/@bbbigdeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;YouTube → &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@bigdeeer?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;youtube.com/@bigdeeer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/6c438768-b421-4d9b-87d8-065b787f5105/DSC00691.jpg?t=1781356253"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/d26029e6-c1a3-4cd5-8f65-f84e086d7bc6/DSC00650.jpg?t=1781356353"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/1b47e11a-2c6a-4f09-aa37-1de07bdb25bb/DSC00709.jpg?t=1781356371"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f083ab73-6412-4ead-a530-716902177120/DSC00642.jpg?t=1781356383"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2ce43d6a-bdbb-49ef-8d63-a4fd0ebe7a26/DSC00721.jpg?t=1781356406"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/fa4bc797-bcf0-4f10-a8ba-25aded6d6fe2/DSC00786.jpg?t=1781356421"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/433084ce-c5c0-427f-a4c0-47ff009ea4e9/DSC00747.jpg?t=1781356434"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/a9cf57db-ccf6-40a5-930d-db8c98101a7b/DSC00761.jpg?t=1781356447"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What are some of the main items in your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vernal L-Shaped Standing Desk&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.apple.com/studio-display/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Apple Studio Display&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Apple Mac Mini&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QeShkY?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Lofree Touch Mouse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/3QmgoOC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Harman Kardon Aura Studio Speaker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://amzn.to/4aqVbtC?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Bambu Lab A1 3D Printer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Split Ergonomic Mechanical Keyboard&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What is the most recent item that you've added to your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;The most recent addition to my workspace is an &lt;a href="https://workspacesxyz.link/LShaped?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=tiancheng-luo" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;L-shaped standing desk from Vernal&lt;/a&gt;. It completely changed the atmosphere of my setup, giving me more space to separate different types of work while making the whole environment feel more organized.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What is one change you'd like to make to your current workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;I’d love for my workspace to feel calmer and more intentional. Not just on the desk surface, but in a more three-dimensional way. Right now, I feel like the wall space still needs more thoughtful design so the entire environment feels more cohesive and organized.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Walk us through your morning routine—what’s the first thing you do at your desk?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Turning on the speakers. That’s always the first thing I do. Music helps me naturally shift into work mode. After that, I usually check messages, organize ideas for the day, and slowly ease into filming or scripting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What’s one productivity trick that actually works for you?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;I think everyone should eventually build their own unique workflow instead of trying to copy someone else’s. Right now, AI probably makes up around 30% of my studio workflow, so learning how to work with AI tools has become really important for me.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What’s the most underrated app or tool you use every day?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;ChatGPT. I think everyone’s ChatGPT becomes different over time. After months of conversations, it starts understanding you on a much deeper level. For me, it’s not just a tool anymore, but something that helps organize ideas, refine concepts, and challenge my thinking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788659481&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=ab3ba0e7-f734-4297-959d-c056ba0949b7&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 13:52:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Jack Zerby</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/240-jack-zerby</link><description>&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,width=1200,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/83ffefc4-12e8-4eba-83aa-2833cea00251/Jack_Zerby_thumbnail.png?t=1781142493"/&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.jackzerby.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Zerby&lt;/a&gt; is currently the Head of Design at &lt;a href="http://gumroad.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Gumroad&lt;/a&gt; and Founder of &lt;a href="http://dogma.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Dogma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://designfordecks.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Design For Decks&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://biddyhq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Biddy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="http://getdohq.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DOHQ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://Flavors.me?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Flavors.me&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://www.businessinsider.com/what-is-goodsie-2011-5?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Goodsie&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He has worked for companies like &lt;a href="https://vimeo.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Vimeo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://pentagram.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Pentagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://frogdesign.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Frog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://rga.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;R/GA&lt;/a&gt; and consulted for companies like &lt;a href="https://teachable.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Teachable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://americanexpress.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Amex&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href="https://staked.us/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Staked&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/jackzerby?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/jackzerby&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/82cc4dc3-638a-4519-812b-2f7d886e502a/image.png?t=1781142289"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b0d3e3c1-2144-499a-9c87-dfa47ed0db9e/image.png?t=1781142303"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/f52ad4d3-6db1-43f2-8909-43f7de552298/image.png?t=1781142317"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/10e73223-99ca-43d5-bc5c-47dc9abef0f8/image.png?t=1781142331"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/bf263210-a906-497a-b49e-a224b5da2dc0/image.png?t=1781142346"/&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/57f0439f-b599-4d90-8837-1a2823061f7d/image.png?t=1781142360"/&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jack's wife recently redesigned his workspace to be what it is you see today. &lt;a href="https://alovelyliving.com/office-update-featuring-ben-moore-caldwell-green/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby#/" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;You can (and should!) see additional photos and thinking behind the redesign here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What gear is included in your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;iMac M1 in Green&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;MAudio Keystation 61 key MIDI Piano &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;EV RE20 Mic for podcasting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pottery Barn Pittsburgh Standing Desk&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://diycandy.com/diy-industrial-pipe-shelving/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;DIY black pipe shelving&lt;/a&gt;‍&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fiddle Leaf Fig tree&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.target.com/p/modern-floor-lamp-with-table-brass-threshold-8482/-/A-85606489?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-zerby" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Standing lamp&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What is your favorite item in your workspace?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;My desk is definitely my fave. It’s got an old classic feel with the benefits of a modern standing desk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How do you spark creativity?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lo-Fi beats station on Spotify and phone on silent. Love sites like siteinspire.com, but will also go to Barnes and Noble and buy a bunch of beautiful magazines in any category.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;How do you manage work-life balance?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;I run everything through Notion and create tickets for all tasks for that week along with goals for each quarter. I stop work at 5:30 no matter what, eat dinner and hang with the fam till bedtime. No work on weekends helps clear my mind and prevent burnout.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What do you think is the main benefit of remote work?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;No distractions, no commuting and ability to structure my day around tasks to be completed, not the amount of hours at my desk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788659481&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=fd1ec894-f391-4e98-9262-7cdd00e472ba&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Jan 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>杰克·雷恩斯</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/252-jack-raines</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://twitter.com/Jack_Raines?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Jack Raines&lt;/a&gt; 是财经博客 &lt;a href="https://www.youngmoney.co/subscribe?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Young Money&lt;/a&gt; 的作者，该博客每周有 31,000 人阅读，每周更新两次。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他还负责编辑 Litquidity 的每日财经通讯 &lt;a href="https://www.execsum.co/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Exec Sum&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他做所有这些的同时，还是哥伦比亚商学院的 MBA 候选人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;趣味事实：他曾被挪威驱逐出境，在阿根廷学会了跳萨尔萨舞，还差点因为一篇讽刺性的 &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jackraines/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;LinkedIn 帖子&lt;/a&gt;被商学院开除。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/2fbcbb73-0bf8-4377-a108-4ac404a2b846/image.png?t=1781141970"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你的工作空间里有哪些装备？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;Macbook Pro&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.thexebec.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=jack-raines" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Xebec（附加的双显示器）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;蓝牙鼠标&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;日记本（严格来说不算是工作空间的一部分，但我总是随身携带）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你工作空间中最喜欢的物品是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我的 Xebec。它便于携带，还能让我的屏幕尺寸变为原来的三倍。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你是如何激发创造力的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我从未主动激发过灵感，而是灵感来找我。创造力通常在我健身、坐地铁，或者凌晨 1 点待在小酒吧时突然迸发。当灵感来临时，我会给自己发几条简短的文字，稍后在电脑前再回顾。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你是如何管理工作与生活平衡的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;管理工作与生活平衡的最好方法，是去做那些你并不需要刻意平衡的事情。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你典型的写作流程是怎样的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我坐下来，先写 15 分钟，然后上 Twitter 找一条想引用的推文，接着在 Twitter 上拖延 20 分钟，把手机扔到床上，关掉 Twitter，继续埋头撰写通讯稿。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788659481&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=9f5948bf-7675-461c-a892-8a62fe13d825&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;由 beehiiv 提供支持&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大卫·海涅迈尔·汉森</title><link>https://workspaces.beehiiv.com/p/253-david-heinemeier-hansson</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;大卫·海涅迈尔·汉森&lt;/a&gt;，也就是DHH，不需要正式介绍。但我们还是准备介绍一下。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是&lt;a href="https://rubyonrails.org/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Ruby on Rails&lt;/a&gt;的创造者，这个开源框架已被数十万开发者使用。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是&lt;a href="https://basecamp.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;Basecamp&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://www.hey.com/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;HEY&lt;/a&gt;的联合创始人。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他是畅销书作家，与联合创始人杰森·弗里德合著了四本书（&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#rework" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《重来》&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#calm" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《工作不必疯狂》&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#remote" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《远程：无需办公室》&lt;/a&gt;和&lt;a href="https://37signals.com/books/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#getting-real" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;《务实》&lt;/a&gt;）。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;如果这还不够，他还是FIA世界耐力锦标赛的&lt;a href="https://dhh.dk/?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson#driver" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;赛车手&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Twitter → &lt;a href="https://twitter.com/dhh?utm_source=workspaces.beehiiv.com&amp;amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;amp;utm_campaign=david-heinemeier-hansson" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" target="_blank"&gt;twitter.com/dhh&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/269219fe-657a-455e-9fce-87aaafb183ec/image.png?t=1781141694"/&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你典型的一天是怎样的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;清晨的时间用来送孩子上学。我通常在8:30左右坐下来开始工作。然后大约花一个小时处理邮件、报告之类的。之后，最好的日子就是完全自由地投入到有趣且有挑战性的项目中，最好是编程或写作。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你认为2023年远程工作的主要好处是什么？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我已经远程工作二十年了，对我来说好处始终如一。可以自由选择居住地，可以在能让人完全平静专注的家庭办公室工作，还可以享受白天就住在家人隔壁的灵活性。给我什么都不换。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2&gt;你是如何在多个进行中的项目之间平衡工作的？&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;我尝试按阶段工作。有些阶段专注于编程，有些用于写作，还有一些用于处理业务本身。多任务处理是一种幻觉。人类所能做的只是瞎忙。所以在同一时间只保留一个主要项目才是快速前进的关键。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figcaption&gt;&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F9e0ab799-69a2-448f-b9a1-c03f8f3356e9%2FLogo_2.png%3Fv%3D1788659481&amp;amp;publication_name=Workspaces&amp;amp;utm_campaign=83a7dc4d-a69e-4e2c-9009-696c7bc81e7e&amp;amp;utm_medium=post_rss&amp;amp;utm_source=workspaces" target="_blank"&gt;Powered by beehiiv&lt;/a&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 09 Feb 2023 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>